# Organization legal form throughout company UI — 2026-10-13

Status: IN PROGRESS. Application authority: /root. The user explicitly requested
adding the existing ООО / ИП / Другое organization legal form everywhere after
seeing that it was absent from the Admin creation form.

## Approved behavior

Use the existing optional legalForm values: empty (not specified), llc (ООО),
sole_proprietor (ИП), other (Другое). Show the same organizational-form field in
every existing company creation/edit form and show its value in company profile
and detail surfaces across Admin, Realization, Financing and Insurance. Include
seller, bank, MFO and insurer companies. Keep company business type
dealer/distributor separate and preserve current access/verification rules.

The field remains optional: minimal company onboarding still needs only name
and first-admin credentials. Submitted values must survive loading/reopening
and an unrelated company edit. Use the existing API/storage contract and shared
labels/options where appropriate; no new enum, migration, permission or provider
workflow. Read-only settings remain read-only where no edit action exists.
Compact company selectors and historical signed documents are not company
profile forms; no unrelated redesign or historical document mutation.

