## Acceptance

L1. Admin creation/edit forms for all four company kinds offer the same optional
legal form and send it through the existing company payload.
L2. Realization company creation/edit and detail facts expose the value.
L3. Shared Financing/Insurance organization settings show the stored value.
L4. Selected values are prefilled on edit, unknown/empty values display a clear
fallback, and minimal creation still works. Existing permission gates remain.

